Assert unwind safety of the worker's message handler

When panics unwind, wasm-bindgen catches a panic in a closure handed to
JavaScript and turns it into a JavaScript exception, but only for a closure
whose captures are unwind safe. The handler a spawning thread installs on
each worker's messages is a boxed FnMut, which is not, so the crate fails to
compile. Asserting it gives it the handling every other closure handed to
the browser has.

